<title>SPAIN: Spain to receive 607 bln ptas from Telefonica sale.</title>
<headline>Spain to receive 607 bln ptas from Telefonica sale.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish government will receive 607 billion pesetas from the privatisation of the state's remaining 20.9 percent of Telefonica de Espana, Economy Minister Rodrigo Rato said on Friday.</p>
<p>At a press conference after today's weekly cabinet meeting he said &quot;this amount, which is extraordinarily big, reflects investor and market confidence in Telefonica's management,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
